{
  "id": "stmt:hse:00455:a:1",
  "type": "Statement",
  "description": "The Republic of Ireland's Health Service Executive (HSE) has approved pembrolizumab (200mg and 400mg) for reimbursement as a first-line treatment option for the treatment of adult patients with metastatic non-small cell lung carcinoma (NSCLC) whose tumors express PD-L1 with a >= 50% tumor proportion score (TPS) with no EGFR mutations or ALK translocations.",
